{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqsktjtz8ch","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","title":"Autowire source chunk seeding fix and the downstream promotion bottleneck on the agent memory bench","summary":"Added a bounded threshold gated source chunk seeding lane to autowireNewTaskWholeGraph (daemon.js): seed up to SOURCE_CHUNK_FANOUT=3 knowledge:source_chunk nodes whose cosine clears a dedicated SOURCE_CHUNK_SEED_THRESHOLD=0.30 floor (independent of the global threshold which is 0 in prod+bench) as weight-0 judged:false chunk->anchor candidates, excluded from the task bucket so neither lane crowds the other. Worst case +3 candidate edges per new task; off-topic tasks seed 0. VERIFIED the seeding works: 25/25 unit tests pass, and in a live longmemeval-oracle run (conv gpt4_2655b836, gold GPS) the GPS-bearing source_chunk note-mqskev3b86q was reliably seeded as a weight-0 candidate for BOTH arms and appears in /judge/next (14 candidate items). HOWEVER end-to-end recall did NOT improve (our-way context_keys=[], our-way-prod predicted I-don't-know, 0/0). ROOT CAUSE is downstream of seeding and environmental: (1) the bench isolated daemon resolves no judge backend (POST /judge/drain returns skipped:no_backend because there is no ANTHROPIC_API_KEY and the embedded daemon's claude CLI is not authed), so weight-0 candidates are NEVER promoted to retrieval-visible and the frozen-DAG our-way arm reads nothing; (2) the our-way-prod agentic search-context path does its own RAG cosine search that does NOT consult weight-0 DAG candidate edges and ranks the GPS source_chunk at ~0.044 (buried under the probe-task self-echoes at score 1.2 that the bench creates in-workspace), stopping after 1 round on the wrong context. So the seeding lane is correct and necessary but not sufficient: the true bottlenecks are judge promotion (blocked by no_backend in the bench) and source_chunk search-ranking, neither of which autowire seeding can fix. The fix should help in a production daemon that HAS a judge backend to promote the now-reliably-seeded candidate.","category":"general","tags":[],"created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-24T21:19:34.823Z","vec":[-0.09353436529636383,0.01396446954458952,-0.06283746659755707,0.01305596437305212,0.063625268638134,-0.07958870381116867,-0.007666307967156172,-0.014596180059015751,-0.03397183120250702,0.023007970303297043,-0.032566770911216736,-0.03280545771121979,0.04174290597438812,-0.041585613042116165,-0.027788229286670685,0.015472686849534512,0.09735748916864395,-0.055395111441612244,-0.04318758845329285,-0.017912326380610466,0.03013157658278942,-0.0223388671875,0.03273552656173706,0.02791767381131649,0.01608392596244812,-0.041655514389276505,-0.09899736940860748,0.0003222027444280684,0.01764751225709915,-0.06309514492750168,0.022770361974835396,0.1112823560833931,-0.050286874175071716,-0.02319217100739479,0.019180184230208397,0.09785211831331253,-0.06458546221256256,-0.010921651497483253,-0.04960944503545761,0.009427426382899284,0.1118868738412857,0.049455057829618454,-0.04600498452782631,0.012198605574667454,-0.023751158267259598,-0.026348963379859924,-0.0537649467587471,0.02519083395600319,-0.075210802257061,-0.09328459203243256,-0.06787990778684616,0.0013627527514472604,0.00218073558062315,0.0693347156047821,0.02504768967628479,0.061073288321495056,0.07623869180679321,0.026346514001488686,-0.019766446202993393,-0.028926637023687363,0.05179257690906525,-0.033184077590703964,-0.05944046005606651,-0.07624483108520508,0.028142469003796577,-0.03140874207019806,0.02198014222085476,-0.015192261897027493,0.07245346158742905,-0.03289113566279411,0.1147586926817894,-0.0152999646961689,-0.06290467083454132,-0.011654908768832684,0.06030755117535591,0.1282106339931488,0.022764144465327263,0.03939550369977951,0.041198719292879105,-0.09206608682870865,-0.048498667776584625,0.004713537637144327,0.03588952496647835,-0.06630049645900726,-0.06187034025788307,-0.06005429849028587,0.034307658672332764,0.008717508055269718,0.10194836556911469,0